{
  "name": "Prospect Outreach - 20 emails every 4 hours",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Prospect outreach drip\nSends **1 email every 12 minutes, around the clock** = **20 emails every 4 hours** (120/day).\n\nTo change the pace, edit the trigger's cron: `*/12 * * * *`. Limit hours with e.g. `*/12 8-19 * * *`.\n\n1. Upload `Trading_Bot_and_Business_Dashboard_Prospects.xlsx` to Google Drive and open it as a Google Sheet (tab name: `Prospects`).\n2. Paste the sheet URL into **Read Prospects** and **Mark as Sent / Mark as Failed**.\n3. Connect your Google Sheets + Gmail credentials.\n4. Set the workflow timezone (Settings) to yours.\n5. Test with **Test workflow**, then toggle **Active**.\n\nOnly rows with an **Email** and an empty **Status** are sent. Each sent row gets `Status = Sent <date>` so nobody is emailed twice.\n\n**If nothing is sent:** open the output of **Pick Next Prospect**. It shows rows read, rows with an email, rows already marked sent, and the column headers it found.",
        "height": 460,
        "width": 420
      },
      "id": "a1f0c0de-0001-4000-8000-000000000001",
      "name": "Setup Notes",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -60,
        -440
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "cronExpression",
              "expression": "*/12 * * * *"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "a1f0c0de-0002-4000-8000-000000000002",
      "name": "Every 12 min (20 per 4 hours)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
